  "bio": "Terrence Cao attends St. Mark's School of Texas and is currently working under the mentorship of Scott Hunt. In his sophomore year, he earned both a gold and silver medal in the Scholastic Art & Writing Awards, with gold medals given out to only 0.2% of entries nationwide. Along with other accolades, he accounted for enough points to be named as a Texas Imagemaker, making him a top ten photographer in Texas. Outside of photography, he is an avid tennis and football player for his high school's varsity teams.",
